{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"dbbe28b82c80a78545c2e3efe820a704130d36921e130e418fdaf8378a693df5"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:1f722a0a6f78578317dcd59ee41dc65e82c0812fc157e0054e948679624d9a12","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"pilates, swimming","evidence":"[D4:12 | 9:48 am on 4 February, 2023] Deborah: When things get tough, just take a deep breath and remember why you're doing this. This is where I spend a lot of my time, teaching yoga. It's a great way to find balance and reconnect with ourselves. I bonded with Anna during yesterday's l yoga class.\n[D4:16 | 9:48 am on 4 February, 2023] Deborah: Yes, but this brought us closer to Anna! We supported each other, that means a lot.\n[D15:1 | 7:37 pm on 9 July, 2023] Deborah: Hey Jolene! I started a running group with Anna - it's awesome connecting with people who care about fitness!","itemId":"urn:uuid:f943ea1e-e2cf-5c8b-a120-839b051597a3","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:6e57de658e7aa9efffb783bcb7800e278bab77a5f08073e4791d172b416227df","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which community activities have Deborah and Anna participated in?","referenceAnswer":"yoga, running","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"6e57de658e7aa9efffb783bcb7800e278bab77a5f08073e4791d172b416227df"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}